# Title logo „Oblatenjagd": chunky lowercase letters (3 px units, 6 px
# strokes) in Oblaten gold - c top highlight, Y fill, o shadow edges - with a
# 2 px O/l depth extrusion to the bottom right and a k outline, so it reads
# over the Salzburg sky at 1x. The "O" is a big Zauner Oblate (c wafer, o
# waffle grid and rim, O shadow side). Origin = centre.
sprite = title_logo
size   = 221x39
origin = 110,19
anim   = idle frames=1
